ad Trip, Cafe, Relaxing, Wedding, Meditation, Workout, Walking, Alone, Travel, Reflection, Rainy Day, Night, Church, Coffee Shop, Gym, Gaming, Study, Dating, Date\n\n5. Singer Timbre (歌手音色)\nSoft, Clear, Warm, Gentle, Smooth, Sweet, Emotional, Mellow, Powerful, Youthful, Bright, Rough, Raspy, Melodic, Deep, Soulful, Strong, Energetic, Breathy, Passionate\n\n6. Topic (主题)\nLove, Relationship, Hope, Longing, Loss, Heartbreak, Memory, Reflection, Life, Faith, Regret, Freedom, Breakup, Nature, Loneliness, Dreams, Nostalgia, Romance, Friendship, Youth\n\n7. Gender (性别)\nMale, Female\n\nOutput Format\n\nOutput ONLY the comma-separated tags.\n\nDo not add explanations.\n\nAim for a mix of Genre, Instrument, and Mood at minimum.\n\nExample Output: pop,piano,emotional,love,soft\n\nUser Request:\n\n[Insert User Description Here]", "", 0.6, 42, "fixed"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link"